id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 479.1171875, 203.25, 490.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 505.9765625, 541.5, 533.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 549.9765625, 546.75, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露\n\n如果误把验证码发给他人、发现本人未发起的验证请求或看到异常登录提示，应停止相关操作并通过企业确认的渠道报告。不要继续向未知联系人提供新的验证码，也不要按陌生消息要求安装不明远程控制软件。\n\n本文仅给出报告原则，不规定账号冻结权限、密码重置步骤或安全事件分级。具体处置需查阅账号与安全事件制度。VPN连接成功不代表某条外部消息可信", "rrf_score": 0.03101, "bm25_score": 6.522479, "vector_score": 0.460009}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c011", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r011", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十一节 允许提供的排查材料"], "token_count": 227, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 461.6171875, 203.25, 473.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 488.4765625, 541.5, 516.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 3, "bbox": [48.0, 532.4765625, 541.5, 560.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十一节 允许提供的排查材料\n\n工单可以包含企业账号标识、客户端显示的错误文字、发生时间、网络类型、目标系统名称以及已经尝试的排查步骤。截图应遮盖无关个人信息、其他系统业务数据和登录凭据，保留与错误相关的区域。\n\n不要提供密码、动态验证码、恢复码或完整的业务数据库内容。日志应通过企业确认的渠道提交，本文未授权把内部日志上传到公开网盘或论坛。需要更详细日志时，", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 7.054414, "vector_score": 0.431117}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c016", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r016", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十六节 人员与设备变化"], "token_count": 127, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 180.25, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 654.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十六节 人员与设备变化\n\n岗位变化、离职交接或设备更换可能涉及访问授权调整，应通过企业正式流程确认。本文没有规定访问资格自动延续、客户端迁移或个人设备替代方式，也不允许将本人账号交给接替人员使用。", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 3.186838, "vector_score": 0.468443}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c006", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r006", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第六节 验证码与时间"], "token_count": 210, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 305.6171875, 157.25, 317.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 332.4765625, 541.5, 360.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 376.4765625, 541.5, 404.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第六节 验证码与时间\n\n出现验证码无效时，先检查验证码是否已过期、是否误输入空格以及设备时间是否明显偏差，再使用本人当前有效的验证码重试。不要连续转发截图寻求他人代填，也不要把验证码写进工单附件。\n\n动态验证码与企业账号密码是不同信息。本文未规定验证码的具体有效秒数、补发次数和锁定阈值；如果提示账号锁定或验证方式不可用，应联系IT服务台，不能按猜测次数持续尝", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 3.85432, "vector_score": 0.465437}]}}
